  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea1178887ff42863f84c86a0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "塔可布莱恩",
      "source_fingerprint": "71539c29764081b35703fe8aa8d1a8790f264614e5d9d3fc1495435e3138d2b9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6",
        "9049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:823c498deac47c3d1d135baf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "保科健子",
      "source_fingerprint": "645d491ebae1a7b6a1f99e2d8c9847055d2ae073a45a7e560275e4958b367263",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6",
        "9050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b5b862476e5b0a5a19d6557",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "汤华盛放",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b2e5f32de1d67199658df06ca0466b0cb68a3f9e36a772aa09d436a856516ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6",
        "9051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53e5f12e9f847558862f82ee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "特雷森学园中每天都有很多事发生。\\n选择<color=#ff9900>育成剧本</color>，解决学园的问题吧。\\n攻略剧本也关系到赛马娘的成长！",
      "source_fingerprint": "560c8788babc0498985033dbb7b3279f87ac3dd2de2cb6ce0a92515f1a72d35c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52fd800d18aeeb8c3edfc143",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使用<color=#ff9900>支援点数</color>和<color=#ff9900>金币</color>来进行<color=#ff9900>Lv强化</color>吧。\\nLv提升后会增加支援效果，\\n因此可以在育成中取得优势。\\n强化素材可从育成或每日比赛中获得。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd2567586af7aab22f115e62cc65d40ba2b4ec703ab6dff7c3580f3e3ebabebd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:daf94a7394e191da3fc172e7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "育成时，比赛中有时也存在「劲敌」。\\n在有劲敌的<color=#ff9900>比赛中取得胜利</color>的话\\n<color=#ff9900>基础能力将上升</color>，<color=#ff9900>也可获得技能的折扣</color>。\\n战胜强敌，帮助赛马娘成长吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22a2d13cdeb71abfa024e0227c845a4c77d893744ad058f94886ca6aa4efd397",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b58f48daabffdfa934702df5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在闪耀明星巅峰赛中，\\n<color=#ff9900>可根据各比赛的名次获得「胜利Pt」</color>，\\n<color=#ff9900>3场比赛合计Pt最高的赛马娘将获胜</color>。\\n和育成的赛马娘一起，以顶点为目标吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88522577d647a3028ed3110563ab4d43150648c55eab3f378b660d122997de02",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa951d7dbd7393d0e57f4a62",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在练习中，可设定<color=#ff9900>喜欢的条件</color>来自由地举办比赛。\\n除了自己育成的殿堂赛马娘，\\n还可以和<color=#ff9900>其他训练员的赛马娘一起</color>参加比赛。\\n最大可让18名赛马娘一起练习。",
      "source_fingerprint": "430b81f44a136a8d558afc56187aa060516123024e74300efa1f112b8d685e48",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7d1c6763893bdf3854ab439",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "将在团队竞技场或房间竞赛等注意到的赛马娘\\n登记为<color=#ff9900>练习伙伴</color>，\\n可以与其一起参赛。\\n另外，所关注好友的代表赛马娘也可参赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "722390448129198d32ee6a3d6a34b33dd5c233111d726ac78badcbb2b87ea622",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:490db9666b75b9e6ed0f09bd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以将自己自豪的<color=#ff9900>殿堂赛马娘</color>在社团或SNS<color=#ff9900>分享</color>。\\n积极与社团成员或朋友登录为练习伙伴，\\n丰富自己的练习吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "372e99fe12d6bc009570e7b08863cf2ab99ac0e8c0a7a1abd1b12ea2953dccea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e289c38bcd501baeb5aff859",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "将想要反复练习的赛马娘们保存到<color=#ff9900>我的参赛名单</color>中、\\n参赛登记时就可以<color=#ff9900>立刻调出</color>！\\n也可以从练习后的结算画面保存，好好活用吧。\\n另外，请注意在解除练习伙伴后，\\n也会将其从我的参赛名单中解除。",
      "source_fingerprint": "662a05795c489af378b7c62fcdda11c478e1c2d5324bb134842e653a7368daaa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2de47cba08bbcbc8bb54712",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "将想要反复练习的赛马娘们保存到<color=#ff9900>我的参赛名单</color>中、\\n参赛登记时就可以<color=#ff9900>立刻调出</color>！\\n也可以从练习后的结算画面保存，好好活用吧。\\n另外，请注意在解除练习伙伴后，\\n也会将其从我的参赛名单中解除。",
      "source_fingerprint": "662a05795c489af378b7c62fcdda11c478e1c2d5324bb134842e653a7368daaa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:103897f33b8d4d3fb1e2cd66",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可在此查看所有考试项目的<color=#ff9900>得分排名TOP100位</color>！\\n<color=#ff9900>TOP30的殿堂赛马娘</color>将作为活动租借对象，\\n且<color=#ff9900>没有</color><color=#ff9900>租借次数上限</color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23117225391dff2209725956510001bb55a473a3501dd12cdf432b6bd459b16a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5d32ee0b022ee35d3713447",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可通过参与考试来获得<color=#ff9900>考试币</color>，\\n且在<color=#ff9900>分数奖励</color>或<color=#ff9900>考试评价</color>、<color=#ff9900>任务</color>中\\n能获得更多考试币！",
      "source_fingerprint": "104dbcf7d96e81e353817e6a227693f1a68b5bb39866e6d55a42322cd8ec42ea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "108"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4d025dd090b78789ca56a3f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使用<color=#ff9900>强化素材</color>，\\n提升育成赛马娘技能的<color=#ff9900>折扣Lv</color>吧。\\n通过提升折扣Lv，\\n育成时的初始<color=#ff9900>折扣Lv</color>将会提高。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72ccf1dd3d3e809f781200c8c18cc197702e644b3b7c2846d444381ad90e7f8e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6748024f4d011620c807bc3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使用<color=#ff9900>相同支援卡</color>来进行<color=#ff9900>上限解锁</color>吧。\\n解锁上限后，支援卡等级上限将会提升，\\n可以将支援卡强化至更高的等级。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a16ccb8857b5325e8d833d069fb6cb0fb92ee5427257871181188956069c4f2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27ee4262da66eea5182084df",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "参加竞速嘉年华的比赛可获得<color=#ff9900>嘉年华点数</color>\\n根据比赛中发动的技能数、名次等，\\n可获得的嘉年华点数会增加。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2823bcfc10d2f77084f78bef761647ad60c88f4c21b2bd9078cb306dcae36567",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1d437c178d87c88dc9b0b3d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "挑战<color=#ff9900>嘉年华比赛</color>可以积累<color=#ff9900>挑战槽</color>。\\n挑战槽积累到最大值时会出现<color=#ff9900>挑战比赛</color>\\n挑战比赛将从<color=#ff9900>VERY HARD、EXTREME</color>中\\n随机出现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b44ce75229e99d291ce87f993c24ed61a7293854b34e3614f598dccf9c0b8d6a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:774e8a21112f948180f45dcf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "活动比赛中进入前5名可获得<color=#ff9900>嘉年华BONUS因子</color>。\\n在育成中继承因子的话，育成赛马娘可获得\\n<color=#ff9900>嘉年华BONUS技能</color>。\\n拥有嘉年华BONUS技能的赛马娘参加活动比赛时\\n<color=#ff9900>基础能力值上升，干劲为绝好调的概率上升。</color>",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68a0470d78c0984bc648015e4d267330966f59585d53ee394cf5e80dce2ed7a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "112"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26930463ecc950a4efa177d9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "拥有<color=#ff9900>嘉年华BONUS技能</color>的赛马娘在活动比赛中进入\\n前5名的话，获得的嘉年华BONUS因子将\\n<color=#ff9900>升级</color>。\\n继承的技能Lv越高，基础能力的上升值\\n越高，干劲为绝好调的概率也越高。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f2172a00bec60ac3131c8956e1602d17f354acd40aac51dc6642d7f0e7c10db",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce6e656f8c5e29ad99ac6d41",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在竞速嘉年华比赛中获得的<color=#ff9900>嘉年华点数</color>可在\\n商店中<color=#ff9900>兑换物品</color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b7ec4a8287b86d18a721377c915ff98f961c6d0a6cc42d5394ecb1729841536",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "114"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17a95234d4c96877b57bb62d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "挑战每日传奇比赛吧。\\n可以获得相应的对战LEGEND赛马娘碎片。\\n每天入场券都会补充至<color=#ff9900>最大张数</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef7750d50dc203ca7c62bc43fdeeec6201e803b0a599a25929fefcb1ea6636bc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "115"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4325cf8552029f9efc9aee5a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你可以制作自己的<color=#ff9900>原创名片</color>，并将名片（图片）\\n<color=#ff9900>分享到SNS上</color>。\\n除训练员信息外，你还可以<color=#ff9900>自定义展示</color>自己喜欢的\\n赛马娘、支援卡以及照片等图像。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb3d37984e1f0e7dd9e3b6fb4a8b6a18a0af740791c872c4d2990f019a8ec994",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "116"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4023a1d2df51c088a423e7df",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "代表赛马娘所持有的<color=#ff9900>因子信息</color>也可以在<color=#ff9900>SNS上共享</color>。\\n使用名片功能来展示让自己引以为豪的赛马娘吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27b42267faf9ff5aeb56fec4f92bea53c020427788889ee89e93ed7cbd266008",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "117"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01ce150ca7061f7e6ec90b35",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使用<color=#ff9900>照片功能</color>，可以在<color=#ff9900>比赛与LIVE</color>\\n功能中拍摄照片。\\n拍摄的照片可以进行加工，\\n也可以添加自己喜欢的效果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6b6e7a53a72f126fe601d6044c9f4e2268fca2b23e5cd3e3ae3d996a950642e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "118"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94f04c12cc765abe8b0580fb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "拍摄的照片会保存在<color=#ff9900>相册</color>中，\\n可以随时进行查看。\\n另外，照片也可以作为<color=#ff9900>训练员名片或社团名片上展示的图像</color>使用。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fbbc77f6dcc2e2352bf4a712e6c00df4082b22caf98465b17f90c10aedbabbe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "119"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6e4fe1c94be6c00e515c781",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最大性能解锁后获得的支援卡会被转换为<color=#ff9900>蹄铁</color>。\\n 蹄铁是珍贵的道具，可以在商店中兑换物品。\\n 已获得的支援卡的性能解锁情况可在支援卡一览中\\n 进行确认，最大性能解锁后再次重复获得的\\n 支援卡会在保管室中被转换为蹄铁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2726e663828955e5f4179c1db2a5576b097660d127c62dc5254290fa499f2c84",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:636238845d69740234c5e132",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中入着（前五名）后除成绩点数之外<color=#ff9900>还可获得「商店币」！</color>\\n商店币可在特殊商店中兑换育成商品。\\n使用育成商品后可以提高基础能力、回复体力\\n或者增加一定时间内训练可获得的属性\\n<color=#ff9900>还可获得对育成有帮助的各种效果！</color>",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a0a3e363b0ec0e716d68b82d4b0cf7b92b6081a4fa65b64938277b157b980c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "120"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8a42b9447e37bf36b93078e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "初次育成，请先了解一下各赛马娘\\n<color=#ff9900>推荐尝试「新设立！URA总决赛」剧本哦！</color>\\n这是关于赛马娘们追寻各自目标的故事，\\n身为训练员的你将与她们共同成长，\\n朝着梦想的大舞台「URA总决赛」的顶点而努力的剧本！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e376116fff35603d4fe81e1b930f295d03f3b2bce4ee03558e39176434d5df1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f0bb045cabd46132c713622",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "本育成剧本中也会出现多个\\n<color=#ff9900>剧本限定育成事件！</color>\\n通过日常点滴小事发现马娘们新的一面，\\n也请务必关注四季中赛马娘们的不同表情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5c66a92709daea984f4089671b699dd1bf0c7fd93a23b628e54a18b1f68cea3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "122"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0012b9f4bbcd81b749ed659b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>大家一起参与的顶尖马娘偶像Project</color>是在育成中\\n通过聚集粉丝来获得奖励的活动。\\n活动个人奖励将根据育成中所获得的粉丝总数\\n来进行发放。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb07f502b2c7cf448adcaa3cded096ec36a8ad5d49e9f55a723049f1b075b8c6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "123"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fb40b6f66de6564f7e7154d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在<color=#ff9900>小金船模式</color>中完成育成后，根据育成进度\\n可获得额外奖励。\\n在小金船模式下，育成比赛中的\\n<color=#ff9900>比赛对手</color>将会增强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e77e58e9854d171dd11cf60cd4c06b1cb48957fc5ee77d64b5b67d1261dead8e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "124"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7c2403ef33e143e7ce33a4c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "活动全体奖励是<color=#ff9900>根据参加活动的全体训练员\\n所获得的粉丝总数</color>来发放的奖励。\\n获得粉丝总数越大，可获得的奖励将越豪华。",
      "source_fingerprint": "482797ce7de6e3d7458070436e8cc8a368bcc7c2a189d186eb0cfaf6f0bb3435",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "125"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f70fe1c8c871677c9d05f98e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>房间竞赛</color>是可以和其他训练员、\\n一起让进入殿堂的赛马娘进行比赛的功能。\\n・<color=#ff9900>举办</color>：可以自己决定条件举办比赛。\\n・<color=#ff9900>参加</color>：可以参加其他训练员举办的比赛。\\n・<color=#ff9900>观战</color>：可以输入比赛的ID观战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8de1ec3a47c258788d658bb9483b2f22609ec112e0efbdb3b7adc8180ba91d68",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "126"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1d0070b7e7e636b40a4fd3a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以GⅠ比赛作为举办的舞台\\n举办比赛时、可以从两种模式中选择举办方法。\\n・<color=#ff9900>简易模式</color>：可以直接举办的模式。\\n・<color=#ff9900>高级模式</color>：可以决定举办时的天气和参加条件的模式。\\n比赛时<color=#ff9900>1人最多可以选择3位赛马娘</color>登记到列表。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e04c792ae32cc81ace1e81e8134aa44e8fe6e304115bc49096efefa255e5f3e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "127"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee6ba6e76fe505f83978c6b9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "举办的比赛可以从参加列表招募参加者。\\n可以使用<color=#ff9900>社团共享功能</color>或<color=#ff9900>SNS共享功能</color>、\\n输入<color=#ff9900>比赛ID</color>的话可以招募身边的训练员\\n顺带一提、也请善用<color=#ff9900>保存功能</color>，这可以观看你感兴趣的比赛。\\n推荐和朋友们一起举办比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "638c946750a9faeff94adc7f18691bedeed4f670e9dccba8ad4fd01e774c4ea2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "128"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50be34d8e34521cf2458db49",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "把想要令其参加房间竞赛的赛马娘保存至<color=#ff9900>\\n我的参赛名单</color>后\\n报名参赛时可<color=#ff9900>立刻调出</color>名单！\\n在房间竞赛的比赛结算页面也可以保存\\n试着活用一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f30a61ae5285c728f70147a554a8434809da7e99d6e31d888c479735c8ad4e99",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "129"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71bf932192134752d6d7e390",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "育成完毕后会作为<color=#ff9900>殿堂赛马娘</color>保存。\\n进入殿堂的赛马娘，除了可以参加团队竞技场和各种比赛之外，\\n还可以在育成中作为继承的对象！\\n另外，移籍后赛马娘将会消失，无法还原。",
      "source_fingerprint": "873e6806e79f598c9b92478dc247758192b17520130a60f021c52b3312773af7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81db684c3d89332c89d446ac",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "把想要令其参加房间竞赛的赛马娘保存至<color=#ff9900>\\n我的参赛名单</color>后\\n报名参赛时可<color=#ff9900>立刻调出</color>名单！\\n在房间竞赛的比赛结算页面也可以保存\\n试着活用一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f30a61ae5285c728f70147a554a8434809da7e99d6e31d888c479735c8ad4e99",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "130"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e21369287637f8c2d9da46c9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "更换您喜欢的赛马娘服装吧！\\n<color=#ff9900>每位育成赛马娘</color>均有服装变更设定，\\n该育成赛马娘所对应的<color=#ff9900>殿堂赛马娘</color>服装也将改变。\\n不过，在部分显示和场景中，服装不会变更。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57f5975a838cb16a8aa4d39d11612ababc698e17d247f8591cc00b7f7f23bec0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:513ef84bc4056231f0733ae6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在育成开始前的最终确认时选择活动加速，\\n育成开始时通过<color=#ff9900>消耗2倍TP</color>，\\n在育成结束后可获得的SHOW量表上升率\\n<color=#ff9900>将变为2倍</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2932fb40eb90809f6a4904159eafae5e3485db2ce6bfa1345496ae47fc08a64c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "132"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5a03f4ac0eb24ab080aacfc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "全部4场告知Live后，将会举办<color=#ff9900>Grand Live</color>！\\n通过<color=#ff9900>习得乐曲</color>，来炒热各场Live的气氛\\n及助力赛马娘们的成长吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70a48c9d20adf1fa427403c468ba63065027f7d0c220b5430736ddfc2492a27d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "133"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50edbf944353f1f711963849",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通过进行训练，能够获得<color=#ff9900>共5种表现分数</color>！\\n各项训练能够获得何种表现分数\\n每回合不同。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fd06c30813740e6c31006d657f1e08a26d740cde2ff3da40a72033004cd8925",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "134"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03779b6f54760b823b2bdde1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可获得的表现分数会根据<color=#ff9900>训练等级</color>及\\n<color=#ff9900>一同参加训练的赛马娘人数</color>增加。\\n另外，<color=#ff9900>友情训练</color>成功的话，\\n可获得<color=#ff9900>2种表现分数</color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb80ea30fffc3c7bbbab858b71e86b4c5a9b11ac28eb842ed5089418b5fdd463",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "135"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2058936f33431b8287bfac5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "获得的表现分数可用于在<color=#ff9900>课程</color>中\\n<color=#ff9900>习得乐曲及Live技巧</color>。\\n习得了乐曲或Live技巧后<color=#ff9900>育成赛马娘能够得到成长</color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "167474d8b9631168f1687bea5174c6e9f4b8f645027d2694dd63caa087f37304",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "136"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d64b48b0ef1505ae34cdebb9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在<color=#ff9900>课程</color>中，可通过消费表现分数来\\n<color=#ff9900>习得乐曲及Live技巧</color>！\\n习得后，可以立刻获得<color=#ff9900>习得加成</color>，\\n且如果习得的是乐曲，还能获得自当场Live结束后生效，\\n至育成结束终止的<color=#ff9900>Live加成</color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e07eb955f991b5526e45373c84b77cae32a46929d577c191bf36e966f235dd1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "137"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c29c949d3ac7d44d20dcb88",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如果习得所需的表现分数不足，可以进行<color=#ff9900>预约</color>。\\n预约后，将在育成及训练界面上方\\n显示习得<color=#ff9900>所需的剩余表现分数</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b16bcbdc093f99e0aaa3a5ec433f02facef7f2730302925080a2c1b41b227821",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "138"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4303585edef7801294a1429",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "习得乐曲后<color=#ff9900>Live期待度</color>将会上升，\\n量表达到最大值时Live就会获得<color=#ff9900>大成功</color>。\\nLive期待度会在每次举办后重置，\\n为各场Live而去学习新歌曲吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1aa9ecdf1ba4bd6f58bb58a1673ed4d8186fffa44b059963d9dbcb6602028356",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "139"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26112eff2bea104ba834483d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "育成赛马娘的碎片可以转换为<color=#ff9900>四叶草</color>。\\n四叶草很珍贵，可在商店兑换其他物品。\\n碎片可以解锁育成赛马娘，也可以用于才能开花\\n转换的时候请一定要注意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1b80efa64073f2a828abe346a46c423b6ee1693a8d9abc1baaa6f64d5f7b2c6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9a2c98c9828271cca9a978d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在<color=#ff9900>Live</color>上，将<color=#ff9900>发表习得的乐曲</color>。\\n如果发表的新学会的乐曲达到一定数量，Live就能<color=#ff9900>获得大成功</color>。\\n以习得乐曲后提高的Live期待度为参考，\\n朝着大成功努力吧！\\nLive获得大成功的话，<color=#ff9900>赛马娘就能够得到充分成长</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a972848a77e3b6b409beb871525f1344596eabc4c80d964ae66d7905707eb680",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "140"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f563ba808ca91516b8b5c23",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在习得新乐曲的状态下结束Live后，\\n<color=#ff9900>Live加成</color>将会自下一回合起生效。\\n同种类型的Live加成，<color=#ff9900>效果将会加算</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "166ae4ae159eb5958fc3845ba98f29a9f603fbba0a99ea6acb7edeffe945ff52",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "141"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a820b51e1e7845d6cab63463",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "所谓<color=#ff9901>特別移籍 StarHorse4 Edition</color>就是将已经进入殿堂的\\n赛马娘移籍至其他队伍中，并获取相应的礼物。\\n不过，送到其他队伍中的赛马娘无法再次寻回，\\n请千万小心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4289f2114dd62b0bd753f0e71ecb520099cb98745fda2b66da35af04277e2e0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "142"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a723c75fc5a0d7d0a12ea7a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每个前来募集移籍赛马娘的训练员都有不同的<color=#ff9901>期待度</color>，\\n移籍赛马娘所能获得的礼物也会随期待度不同而变化。\\n<color=#ff9901>那个训练员</color>会给出<color=#ff9901>期待度4</color>的募集请求吗……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa60c2a7b126251807484af87e40fefcb58ffb39074738690cfa899e0777c0c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "143"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a8a1b40bef7be0b329d98c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若是满足期待度3的募集要求，\\n便能获得对应的<color=#ff9901>被移籍赛马娘的碎片</color>。\\n若是能完成期待度高于3的募集要求的话，\\n便能获得<color=#ff9901>StarHorse4 Edition</color>独有的新道具\\n<color=#ff9901>「星之果实」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f0b447e5d86f2bfd65163392d2e586d6b7ad31669fff670991ef7bfebca56a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "144"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d59af8c949c8d93e4b2119a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>签约赛</color>需要以7人组成队伍才可参加。\\n队长由自己拥有的殿堂赛马娘担任，\\n队长以外的六人则可以靠<color=#ff9900>签约</color>来进行替换。\\n不断进行<color=#ff9900>比赛</color>与<color=#ff9900>签约</color>，以成为最强队伍为目标努力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32015f1caa8c30e693209b2f60d88eae0d97717c6a17dc25b5099e48b846cd04",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "145"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:433b5f344b70d3da81bff29f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>签约赛入场券</color>会在每日12点恢复至5张。\\n同时，还可以通过完成每日任务或使用道具等手段恢复。\\n<color=#ff9900>赛场环境</color>将<color=#ff9900>每3场比赛替换一次</color>。\\n替换后的赛场环境请于比赛预览界面进行确认。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf4a0cfb785e843ae286fd5246eff92f1a526cd9815270720020ac41f4dea16f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "146"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a3a7360701285f0fe1c04ce",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "参加签约赛之后，能获得<color=#ff9900>签约Pt</color>。\\n比赛的胜负与对方队伍的等级也会影响<color=#ff9900>签约Pt</color>的获得量。\\n在各种各样的赛场环境中让队伍的全员都尽可能参赛，\\n以胜利为目标不断努力吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc23561c5f9a09f0c5baa0b3ab7c10a515731e876fa179638489bae8da9998ff",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "147"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c05c5a34f6b5c2b7fe58b41",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在<color=#ff9900>签约时间</color>时，能够与对方队伍的赛马娘进行<color=#ff9900>签约</color>，\\n并且替换自己队伍中的赛马娘。\\n签约所需的<color=#ff9900>签约Pt</color>会随着被签约赛马娘的\\n等级高低而变化。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca78cef1632f858722f35306442f3bbb1bce24554802afa8cd763aa9453a23f4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "148"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93ca3e54cef79bc908506d10",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "强化队伍后，若是能<color=#ff9900>更新队伍最高等级</color>的话，\\n可以获得相应的报酬。\\n同时，若是完成<color=#ff9900>限定任务</color>的话，也能获得相应的报酬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0e9d77f1966a77ac3bba81eaf5fd6aad34dca5a47ded7fdbed4fc0f4e195d90",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "149"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:568feee378aae4ec9e4e6c27",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "率领队伍＜天狼星＞，\\n与赛马娘们一起推进<color=#ff9900>主线故事</color>吧！\\n推进故事可以获得报酬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96e2a1f555cdde647e32c1f10ad56bebe4fe3f35316bf294f43adbc3acd47d89",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67f2a112322d1348bd084ac1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如果在<color=#ff9900>签约赛</color>中获得<color=#ff9900>胜利</color>的话，参赛的队长与\\n队员赛马娘都将会被<color=#ff9900>记载于名册</color>，\\n队伍全员的基础能力与获得签约Pt都会有加成。\\n此外，若是将特定的赛马娘同时编入队伍，\\n并且获得签约赛的胜利的话，便能获得<color=#ff9900>队伍技能</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4af7c8dd5fcc96731b13c3ec49b34961da5000e5d0aeb7953ed37a459318c008",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "150"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06d329a9aea089b613e2567c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>活动加速</color>是指，育成开始时通过消耗2倍TP，\\n在育成结束后可获得的<color=#ff9900>考试币</color>将变为2倍。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5db8fe0bd9d9cd9cf7a4b950ef42ec9d6f33f750a55717911606b4611499f53",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "151"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa846c4944824881e3f6f1a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通过<color=#ff9900>每日登录散步奖励</color>和<color=#ff9900>游玩各项游戏内容</color>来\\n积攒<color=#ff9900>散步量表</color>。\\n每<color=#ff9900>积攒1支散步量表</color>，便可以同赛马娘一起去<color=#ff9900>散步1次</color>。\\n※每天可积攒2支量表。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36ae5dd236a2f96d9046d16126dfc20dbb61c28c247b6867b466e77a91e01600",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "152"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d5834d49abb79bb147a4de3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以在摄影棚中于<color=#ff9900>训练</color>、<color=#ff9900>外出</color>等各种场合\\n拍摄<color=#ff9900>照片</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c21aa81540ac1be3149d9de3c65ac9033fa63d7374e51aef6c1c9bea344d8c17",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "153"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec5e53e7644082663ae8c900",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "选择想要拍摄照片的赛马娘后，\\n进行<color=#ff9900>季节与外出地点</color>的设置吧。\\n在<color=#ff9900>训练</color>的拍摄中，还可以设置练习伙伴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26a6e1712a290f885247ee02bcabbe17eb4bda3476852d7b5352c078ab96235b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "154"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abf880ef27e44484e37d973d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "拍摄照片时，可以进行<color=#ff9900>画面暂停・循环</color>的操作。\\n找到最好的时机，拍出自己最喜欢的一张照片吧。\\n对拍摄的照片，还可以进行<color=#ff9900>设置滤镜等加工</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ed78ed8d8c51734a8eda4b05b236828a5240874971b96542240b57467244425",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "155"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e389fd62970ffa8739b2ebf0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进行散步之后，作为<color=#ff9900>散步同伴</color>赛马娘的<color=#ff9900>亲密度</color>将会上升。\\n另外，根据所选的散步目的地，还会播放活动限定的\\n<color=#ff9900>散步演出</color>，并可以获得<color=#ff9900>散步奖励</color>。\\n已观看过的演出，可在活动期间内长按赛马娘图标，\\n在「已解锁演出确认」界面重复观看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f88c89d303651d8b5c7f29b453b48f67ff5e0de66ec757b86c57da2d73170896",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "156"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40ac21124343674f43a7726c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在「KIRARI MAGIC SHOW」活动页面，\\n可以查看有关圣诞礼物活动的信息，\\n还可以参与将于12/21举行的TOKYO MEGA ILLUMI联动活动。\\n并且，可以点击<color=#ff9900>每天出现1次的小礼物</color>来获得奖励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73418f48b2206ce6b9b50b4030911ebb9ba0d08a3d93d816309d0211da3cc67d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "157"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6b4fa24a452765c9138b41e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "3.5th Anniversary特别活动「UMA Summer」，\\n是一项通过育成来帮助赛马娘们分发中暑击退饮料的活动。\\n在本活动中，根据<color=#ff9900>你分发的中暑击退饮料数量</color>，\\n可获得<color=#ff9900>活动个人奖励</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d93147e140bac5c49f00bb5c9040365dddbb07bb84fdc48eed8aec6b90beec9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "158"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2136d8000e6c70131085a249",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练中<color=#ff9900>快乐米可登场！</color>\\n和快乐米可一同切磋琢磨3年，\\n以在URA总决赛中出场为目标吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7010c3eab38bc3607b95a0f3f973e6d1ff3d77346ffeabc6b8f6ef310d5ed521",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "159"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6cb5cb7bdf17fb0ff0ca544",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "与育成赛马娘邂逅，提高<color=#ff9900>亲密度</color>\\n以此推进<color=#ff9900>赛马娘故事</color>吧！\\n亲密度可在育成或团队竞技场中提升。\\n推进故事可以获得报酬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa7546e7c892483a9b80a2d157983b6e16414a24d5ea6833698137da20a88345",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "16"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7180ffcf15d4d5e047bfdc29",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "随机与快乐米可一同训练后，\\n会发生互相比拼基础能力值与体力值的<color=#ff9900>对决事件</color>！\\n对决项目的数值越高越容易获胜，\\n所以通过训练来强化自身后再挑战对决吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9040b7eaf573cb3dfd101cd4184b9d9227131cb39e6bdef1686a196715e0ec9d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "160"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69c0f3dff6269396751c01fe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "育成期间在对决中积累一定次数的胜利后，\\n<color=#ff9900>实力提升的快乐米可</color>将在URA总决赛决赛中登场！\\n和培育的育成赛马娘一起，在决赛的舞台上以获得优胜为目标吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92e619ab4fd84a7fc0144063b0bd3fcc4c0dc304078f43424e7f14b7a9df50ac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "161"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0058f76eccd384e6b67968f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "已爆发青春之魂的队伍成员如果发生青春特训，\\n将会发生仅一次的<color=#ff9900>极・青春之魂爆发</color>！\\n发生后，该队伍成员的<color=#ff9900>基础能力将大幅提升</color>，\\n<color=#ff9900>育成赛马娘也将在成长时获得特别技能折扣</color>！\\n在育成中凭借<color=#ff9900>极・青春之魂爆发</color>掀起更大的波澜吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfe34ab434012c75267cd36eb6ccebfd87e68290896f01b2503dc8952a99ea2b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "162"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69dac93e2300b3c11e339b35",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如果满足了<color=#ff9900>特殊条件</color>的话，青春杯中将会出现<color=#ff9900>豪强队伍</color>！\\n战胜了豪强队伍的话<color=#ff9900>育成赛马娘将大幅成长</color>！\\n并且，<color=#ff9900>还可能会在青春杯正式赛时发生些什么</color>……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1ff63c715efe0ca24f70f3dd530898731f231bd382be1298e41e489ce325a4d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "163"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85cb9d36d77aaddb8d54ad37",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "根据<color=#ff9900>大家分发的中暑击退饮料数量</color>，\\n还可获得<color=#ff9900>活动全体奖励</color>。\\n请全体参加活动的训练员们尽可能多地分发中暑击退饮料，\\n让节日的气氛高涨起来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fafa6ceb917d2d1e7c76cc0e2aca6f9d0fc36bebc665df8c98f8918d9486f144",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "164"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99957a1cad9f2d178d0ce19e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在活动举办期间进行育成，可以赠送写有<color=#ff9900>应援信息</color>的灯笼给小栗帽。应援信息（图片）可以<color=#ff9900>在社交媒体分享</color>。此外，还可以查看其他训练员制作的应援信息。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2657c3cb0266f819343c519b0a072b99a6d6799a7a0d9f49b7edd91df43b31d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "165"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b891cf802a1beba777544360",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "本育成剧本中，需要在3年时间内有效利用三女神的支援，\\n挑战各育成赛马娘的目标！<color=#ff9900>育成目标全部\\n达成的话，将举办特别比赛「Grand Masters」！</color>\\n在与女神们的决斗中取胜，并以获得优胜为目标吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aecf6931d2d8a4b8ba0b0a571776ac0849508e6a6cbe2c359b9ebdfeb6061686",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "166"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:273893fd5b559bdd1c66062f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "育成期间，进行训练、休息、外出和比赛时，\\n都可获得来自三女神的<color=#ff9900>知识的碎片</color>！\\n知识的碎片能够自动触发<color=#ff9900>训练所获得基础能力提升</color>等\\n各种有助于育成的效果。\\n<color=#ff9900>进行友情训练的话还可以一次性获得2个！？</color>",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c3bd19dde83fcdfc3d8cf6633236d08ce5d183d4712603505760e45ce1b1b7a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "167"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2be12657c1ee28c42bfb8afd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "收集满2个知识的碎片，即可额外获得<color=#ff9900>知识的结晶</color>！\\n知识的结晶也同样是获得后效果自动生效，\\n能够强化训练所获得基础能力。\\n<color=#ff9900>原有知识的碎片的效果仍会继续生效</color>，\\n所以去不断收集来强化赛马娘吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "79a62612e1488299b0653ffd0a315e3ee0f9b23da0ac154aec2480cc02f45efc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "168"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
